# Admin dashboard UI

- Reuse `resources/js/components/ui/*` and `components/content-card.tsx`. Do not write one-off versions of components that already exist.
- Pages declare `Page.layout = { breadcrumbs: [...] }`. The layout already provides padding, so do not add outer padding or a page `<h1>` styled heading.
- Sidebar items live in `resources/js/lib/nav.ts` and must use Wayfinder route functions. Use `adminOnly: true` for admin pages.
- List pages must use `components/table/*` with `useTableParams` (query-string driven, Inertia visits). Do not fetch table data on the client.
- Forms use Inertia `<Form>` with `Field`, `FieldLabel` and `FieldError`. Do not add react-hook-form or zod.
- Use Wayfinder (`@/actions`, `@/routes`) for every URL. Never hardcode paths.
- Colors come from the theme variables in `resources/css/app.css` (`--brand`, `--primary`, ...). Do not hardcode brand colors in components.
- Run `pnpm run check:fix` and `pnpm run types:check` after changing frontend code.
